<title>POLAND: Jelfa Q1 net rises to PLN 6.1 mln.</title>
<headline>Jelfa Q1 net rises to PLN 6.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jelfa preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 8.04 vs	6.50</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   7.60 vs	6.83</p>
<p>    net profit				 6.05 vs	4.75</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Jelfa SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 40.13 vs     35.43</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  22.30 vs     22.17</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				 1.34 vs	0.83</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.21 vs	1.24</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.36 vs	0.55</p>
<p>    financial costs			  0.79 vs	0.22</p>
<p>    investment				 5.76 vs     12.20</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
